{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>Take the Levites.</b> On another occasion it is as if it said: when you take the Levites, the excess ones shall be a ransom, and the word פדויי is connected to \"the number,\" and there are many like it. There are those who dispute; they said: from this we learn that the redemption of every firstborn is five shekels. But it is no proof, for this is a commandment on its own, and the truth is a matter of tradition."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:11.870765816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}